## Context
The author, 2026-11-09: "That docs/ should be design/." In the harness's conventions `docs/` is a git-ignored
staging folder for reading material (lair's zotero trigger scans it), while git-erg's `docs/` holds tracked
design records, audits and the generated manual; the trigger misfired on it at today's lair.

## Exit criteria
- [x] `git mv docs design`; every live reference (README, AGENTS.md, CHANGELOG, the PEP, process docs, the
      Makefile `docs` target, tests, demo.sh, three comments in `src/go/main.go`) names `design/`.
- [x] `make check` passes.

## Pin
The `src/go/main.go` comments make CI rebuild the binary with a new revision stamp, which moves the
claims-rollout pin off 6a104262. The author, 2026-11-09: "Bite the bullet, move the pin."
